Value LOCAL_DISCRIMINATOR (\d+)
Value REMOTE_DISCRIMINATOR (\d+)
Value PEER_IP (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)
Value STATUS (\S+)
Value SESSION_TYPE (\S+)
Value INTERFACE (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*${LOCAL_DISCRIMINATOR}\s+${REMOTE_DISCRIMINATOR}\s+${PEER_IP}\s+${STATUS}\s+${SESSION_TYPE}\s+${INTERFACE}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*Local\s+Remote\s+PeerIpAddr
  ^\s*Total\s+UP/DOWN\s+Session\s+Number
  ^\s*-+
  ^\s*\(w\):
  ^\s*\(\*\):
